# Copy to .privacy-denylist (gitignored) and list the real values that must
# never appear in this public repo, one per line, at least 4 characters. The
# pre-commit privacy-check hook reads it; CI reads the PRIVACY_DENYLIST secret.
# Matching is case-insensitive substring. The matched text is never printed.
#
# Host names (short and full)
<hostname>
<hostname>.<lan-domain>
# Tailnet name (the part before .ts.net)
<tailnet>
# Login user names, on every machine
<username>
# Personal or work email addresses and domains
<email>
# Public IPs, SSIDs, anything else that identifies the owner
